<Tips>
  Liv is not defeatable here, she will kill everyone present. But as long as Banks is alive, she can resurrect everyone else after.
  The only way to stop Liv killing someone is to remove them from the fight completely.
  You have one ability that can remove someone from the fight in a way that returns them later. Liv doesn't know they come back.
  Create a Death's Door and push Banks into it. Let everyone else die.
</Tips>

